# Quarc cape: no cape-header I/O, GPIO, or fabric interrupts are used.
# The entire design is an APB slave window (FIC3, 0x4110_0000) into the
# Quarc Step 1 crypto fabric, so this constraint file intentionally carries
# no set_io commands. Keep this file present: BUILD_BVF_GATEWARE.tcl imports
# it unconditionally via
#   -io_pdc "./script_support/components/CAPE/$cape_option/constraints/$board/cape.pdc"
# ($board = mpfs-beaglev-fire for openbeagle CI fork builds).
